{"3531750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Catventure: The Curse of the Dark Tower", "steam_appid": 3531750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vampire's tower rises in the heart of darkness. To save his mother, the adventurous cat must face monsters, bosses, and traps on every floor. In this roguelike, you take on the role of a fearless archer cat named Ryu on an epic journey to confront the forces of darkness! With every step inside the tower, you will encounter hordes of battle-hungry enemies. Using quick reflexes and sharp strategy, dodge projectiles, shoot with precision, and unleash special abilities to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME HIGHLIGHTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗡️ <strong>Intense bullet-hell action</strong> – dodge swarms of projectiles while taking down enemies with your bow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/extras/496d5ae0ee2afdcdfb1f53e16b276c96.poster.avif?t=1788309312\" width=900 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/extras/496d5ae0ee2afdcdfb1f53e16b276c96.webm?t=1788309312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/extras/496d5ae0ee2afdcdfb1f53e16b276c96.mp4?t=1788309312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Strategic progression system</strong> – choose between attribute upgrades, skills, and passive abilities at each level-up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/extras/d3d18dadda6108491369772874263f20.poster.avif?t=1788309312\" width=900 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/extras/d3d18dadda6108491369772874263f20.webm?t=1788309312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/extras/d3d18dadda6108491369772874263f20.mp4?t=1788309312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ <strong>Forge and upgrade equipment</strong> – strengthen your character to take on greater challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/extras/b7e6981efbb7c3554cb6674f9b30a3d7.poster.avif?t=1788309312\" width=900 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/extras/b7e6981efbb7c3554cb6674f9b30a3d7.webm?t=1788309312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/extras/b7e6981efbb7c3554cb6674f9b30a3d7.mp4?t=1788309312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦇 <strong>Epic boss battles</strong> – fight colossal enemies and master their attack patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/extras/16915ae91f7deff15ea3c16ddd505196.poster.avif?t=1788309312\" width=900 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/extras/16915ae91f7deff15ea3c16ddd505196.webm?t=1788309312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/extras/16915ae91f7deff15ea3c16ddd505196.mp4?t=1788309312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for battle and find out if you have what it takes to defeat the vampire and save your beloved!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vampire's tower rises in the heart of darkness. To save his mother, the adventurous cat must face monsters, bosses, and traps on every floor. In this roguelike, you take on the role of a fearless archer cat named Ryu on an epic journey to confront the forces of darkness! With every step inside the tower, you will encounter hordes of battle-hungry enemies. Using quick reflexes and sharp strategy, dodge projectiles, shoot with precision, and unleash special abilities to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME HIGHLIGHTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗡️ <strong>Intense bullet-hell action</strong> – dodge swarms of projectiles while taking down enemies with your bow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/extras/496d5ae0ee2afdcdfb1f53e16b276c96.poster.avif?t=1788309312\" width=900 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/extras/496d5ae0ee2afdcdfb1f53e16b276c96.webm?t=1788309312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/extras/496d5ae0ee2afdcdfb1f53e16b276c96.mp4?t=1788309312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Strategic progression system</strong> – choose between attribute upgrades, skills, and passive abilities at each level-up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531750/extras/d3d18dadda6108491369772874263f20.poster.avif?t=1788309312\" width=900 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c